    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e5ccfd3bf4ffd94c7ad54ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他的事，吗？那个，我想想。\n她本来就是个沉默寡言的人――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9812a32d86b23539afbbeb284a020d14c6227007d8e6f7563cf794fd5eae8cab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdebcafeaca0b1982418c9d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来是这样",
      "source_fingerprint": "968c1b4eb61676c718dfa39ed8d0378bcab47815c5dec3d2f7ac4b90f5b184c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ad358fa6de9500da28b0346",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff8cb3082a2b665288d79fe1158a2cb684903cee1feb8acf5983b563c7b8b935",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
