      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffa20921bb4246451a4292e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不过说起来，神宫同学现在\n确实已经比以前话多了不少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9e604c287566f8285575fb9b2351e0d6bdedbe585fb40d5739099b2f8485129",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2da7e02a61e615f5304125",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:092989e2bacb60e4c0f1cea8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想是在她进入特雷森学园以后。\n她也会，偶尔……尽管只是零零碎碎地，\n对尚未入学的我说起学园里的朋友。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07df8922389f3b7abb5da22aad0cbf7245059ff500aa552d3047cb57a92bd84b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95fe1bd65cffda1cd12119da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7415a519ad71a72413ec5e29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怒涛前辈、速子前辈与跳舞城前辈，\n还有美妙前辈……我当时觉得她身边\n已经有了许多朋友。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dcd78029a51d7fb9fafebbe10309b8d798991c4ffbd506907b9847ec010c9f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c30e1044e3ca67fe86e34dc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:346e8ddb85f679d23c82083c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前几天，我们正好也聊到了类似的话题――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed407ea7bd600a6c1e47e0247dbbac4383d387e522d357310ff703022d7e0824",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1cb6d20a2beb06075b8f6c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d163f9226d35d1189db726ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵。……回过神时，反而是我一直在说\n莱茵同学、西沙里奥同学\n和勇心同学的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73aaa9b4ec689f18a058b5bb5fda622416aeea06983d1e5635473d096dd74b1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:868efc61cb71f79ee987ab79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是不是在担心，你有没有交到朋友",
      "source_fingerprint": "226f95cbce0c6c1d43417bee64293ad82ba553fb39b0585de93d08f8fd0de6bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1062a9abe601d95246db9215",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479a9ad10c0c22ead519f590",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在想来……\n或许是她很巧妙地套出了我的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1898d406b1f0686f88f347e9cd85f546315b47388205d9a5611fc3e57d24262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46bd4c5056c9a6a52eaca3fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫……她不仅年级与世代都在前，\n还是以头脑敏锐闻名全校的两冠赛马娘――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b463fa227612718200734b7d74adb163e3c2c639bd65b503887f498fd268bb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b26e9c47edea93fb0a756d42",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，我不是那个意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0da971e2c9679afb124494599ee5ad8551083ee7b62652824cc011dfb213fb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f36d9a79a72234e06593463",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:790b03e81fb6943713acee1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶？\n我……看起来像没有朋友吗？朋友……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08f07d639733661fac77ef65a8848802226a6841979368e4693ddd0c628c75de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1611d54814cff963bb587d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果是从小认识的人，多少会担心\n对方在学园里过得开不开心吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971a101d923e1c85a594b8a9bd641589433008f65c213a7f0f806a782ed5a256",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        81,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/81/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c3ec0085860ce8ad338060",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫是不是也抱着这样的想法？\n我这样，问了问她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7fe3c2ba8c5a82f2de755ccb06742cb5efc7e271254f775bfbc2b7412fd095a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        82,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/82/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631035bfcf8d48a3433afb02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
